- Area can also be written using the formula:
  $$
  \Delta = \frac{abc}{4R}
  \Rightarrow 6(a + 2\sqrt{30}) = \frac{abc}{4 \cdot 13}
  \Rightarrow abc = 6(a + 2\sqrt{30}) \cdot

$$
s = \frac{a + b + c}{2}, \quad s - a = 2\sqrt{30}, \quad s - b = \frac{a + c - b}{2}, \quad s - c = \frac{a + b - c}{2}
$$

